        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Khalipe Celestial, Vulture Ejection and Silver Veil"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Vulture Ejection is Khalipe's Identity\nVulture Ejection has Celestial\nCelestial means the card will be Activated when a 2+ AP Card is played\nVulture also has Silver Veil\nSilver Veil stacks up to 3, at 3 Khalipe will do 400% Def based damage\nThat's alot of Damage"
          }
        }
      ]
