            "en": "Zeta: Multi Damage to Kahlipe high modifiers, targeted draw EP Skill\nRachel: Free Counterattack sometimes and draw EP Skill\nWilhelma: Def to increase damage the most and alson Moral EP Skill\nEishelen: Passive isn't good, but the EP Skill can retain shield, not very good"
